A||||8||DXR_DAD||" IF YOU BUILD IT THEY WILL ASK "||||1
Z||000000||DXR_DAD||09-18-1999||07:04 PM||||What's up guys, Last night while out for a cruz I looked in my review and saw 2 sets of head lights, I knew what they were...yep, FIEROS, one black 84 and one red 84. I slowed up they  both pulled up, one behind, one on my side. He asked me to pull over and I did. We all got out of our cars to talk. They both asked me how did I keep my car looking so good. Both cars were in need of some work. The red one was in need of alot. They asked if they could see my engine and the inside, it was like a car show to them. One of the guys said he had seen my car around and wanted to stop me many times.<P>Again he asked how I do it, keep it looking and running so good.  So Cliff I told him  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl</A> <P>Thanks to all who make this site what it is.<BR>The best darn Fiero site on the web. And it's getting bigger and better. Cliff keep up the good work!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Patrick||09-18-1999||07:24 PM||||<BR>Whenever I've been asked to pull over, it's been to give me a ticket. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||DXR_DAD||09-18-1999||11:23 PM||||Patrick, kinda hard to stay off that "go-fast" when you drive a fiero.||||reg||1
Z||000003||ChadMan||09-20-1999||08:50 AM||||As long as I've had Fieros, when I've seen another on the road, I give the driver a toot and friendly wave.  Used to be all I got back was "deer-in-the-headlights" blank looks, but within the last year or two, Fiero drivers have started waving back.  Motorcyclists and Vette drivers do this - why not us?||||reg||1
Z||000004||kornholio||09-20-1999||04:41 PM||||I always get a strange look or a nodd of the head from other Fiero drivers.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Standard||09-21-1999||12:06 AM||||I always try to wave to any fiero drivers I see.. most of the time they wave back, especially if I chased them down just to wave..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000006||Harry||09-21-1999||06:07 PM||||I try to wave at every one I see, how ever some of the people driving seem to be either stuck up/snooty/ or just plain unfriendly.<BR>I think at times I got a better wave response from the camaro guys (I used to have one)<BR>The other day though somebody actually was checking me out in his rear view as i came up behind him at a light in N.C. I saw him looking and waved, he returned the wave and made me feel all better again about friendly people.||||reg||14
